{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "20094",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.24,
      "end_seconds": 2.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "Morning, come on through."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 3.66,
      "end_seconds": 6.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Doctor, thank you for seeing us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.51,
      "end_seconds": 9.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "Where shall we begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 10.9,
      "end_seconds": 15.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "We came because of a cough that won't go away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.53,
      "end_seconds": 20.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "When was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.11,
      "end_seconds": 26.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "It's, It's been going on for two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.15,
      "end_seconds": 31.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "How much trouble does it give you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.67,
      "end_seconds": 55.76,
      "duration_seconds": 23.09,
      "text": "I'd call it mild. I've had a bit of a sore throat too, for about a week. I've also been getting breathless on the stairs, for five days. As for getting breathless on the stairs, a six out of ten, I suppose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.45,
      "end_seconds": 63.08,
      "duration_seconds": 6.63,
      "text": "Have you had a cough that won't go away before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.04,
      "end_seconds": 69.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "A bit, last winter. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.05,
      "end_seconds": 83.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.19,
      "end_seconds": 86.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "I've got asthma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.44,
      "end_seconds": 92.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "Yes. Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.31,
      "end_seconds": 96.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Not to my knowledge, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.98,
      "end_seconds": 101.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.98,
      "end_seconds": 116.31,
      "duration_seconds": 13.33,
      "text": "I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago. I'm vegetarian and have been for years. I live with my elderly mother. I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.05,
      "end_seconds": 121.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 121.98,
      "end_seconds": 125.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "It's Foracort inhaler, twice a day, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.47,
      "end_seconds": 137.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Have you been to theatre before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.83,
      "end_seconds": 154.82,
      "duration_seconds": 14.99,
      "text": "Yes, I had my tonsils removed, as a teenager. I've been reading about it online and it worried me. I took the morning off to come in today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.48,
      "end_seconds": 157.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "Any leg swelling?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.17,
      "end_seconds": 161.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "Definitely no leg swelling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.88,
      "end_seconds": 167.79,
      "duration_seconds": 5.91,
      "text": "Any sharp chest pain, weight loss, night sweats or fever at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.65,
      "end_seconds": 175.1,
      "duration_seconds": 5.45,
      "text": "No, no sharp chest pain, weight loss, night sweats or fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.62,
      "end_seconds": 179.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "On the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.8,
      "end_seconds": 184.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "My heart's been fine, as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.61,
      "end_seconds": 191.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.22,
      "end_seconds": 193.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "Nothing there, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 195.25,
      "end_seconds": 206.55,
      "duration_seconds": 11.3,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Pressure 121 over 71, respiratory rate 18, pulse is 79 beats a minute. Temperature is 36.8 degrees, SpO2 99 percent on room air."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.83,
      "end_seconds": 233.56,
      "duration_seconds": 25.73,
      "text": "Thanks. Going by what you've described, it fits best with a lingering cough after a viral infection. It could also be cough-variant asthma, so we'll keep that open. Let me just check I've got this right. You've had a cough that won't go away for two weeks, mild, and no weight loss or fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 235.12,
      "end_seconds": 236.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 255.53,
      "end_seconds": 259.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "We've already done a chest X-ray this morning, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.35,
      "end_seconds": 266.38,
      "duration_seconds": 5.03,
      "text": "Great, that's useful. I'd like to arrange a breathing test for breathlessness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 268.37,
      "end_seconds": 270.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Oh, is that done today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.87,
      "end_seconds": 301.7,
      "duration_seconds": 29.83,
      "text": "I'd like you to take salbutamol inhaler, 100 micrograms, two puffs when needed, for two weeks. That should help with wheeze and cough. Honey and lemon in warm water can ease it, and avoid smoky rooms. Do get help quickly if you cough up blood or get breathless at rest. Book a review in three weeks. Can you tell me the plan back in your own words, so I know I've explained it clearly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.52,
      "end_seconds": 313.45,
      "duration_seconds": 9.93,
      "text": "So, I take the salbutamol inhaler, 100 micrograms, two puffs when needed and come back in three weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.65,
      "end_seconds": 321.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 322.13,
      "end_seconds": 324.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "Thank you, that's helpful."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 327.66,
      "end_seconds": 329.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Right, all the best."
    }
  ]
}